---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About - Packetvision LLC | Stuart Bain, Solutions Architect & Founder" 
  description="Learn about Packetvision LLC and founder Stuart Bain - AWS Solutions Architect, USMC veteran, and IT executive with 25+ years of experience in enterprise software development."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <section class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-white">About Packetvision LLC</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Founded in 2002 and based in Salem, Virginia, Packetvision LLC combines deep technical expertise 
        with strategic business insight to deliver innovative software solutions for modern enterprises.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Company Story -->
    <section class="mb-20">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Our Story</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Packetvision LLC was founded with a vision to bridge the gap between complex enterprise technology 
            and practical business solutions. What started as a specialized Linux and open-source consulting firm 
            has evolved into a comprehensive technology partner for businesses of all sizes.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Over more than two decades, we've maintained our commitment to technical excellence while expanding 
            our capabilities to include cloud architecture, AI automation, and modern DevSecOps practices. 
            Our approach combines hands-on engineering expertise with strategic business thinking.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Based in the heart of Virginia's Blue Ridge Mountains, we serve clients nationwide, bringing 
            enterprise-grade solutions with the personal touch and reliability of a trusted local partner.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-6">Company Highlights</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong>Founded:</strong> 2002 in Salem, Virginia</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong>Focus:</strong> Enterprise software development, cloud architecture, and AI solutions</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong>Specialization:</strong> AWS cloud platforms, secure government solutions, open-source technologies</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-blue-500 rounded-full mt-2 flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span><strong>Philosophy:</strong> Technical excellence with collaborative partnership approach</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Founder Bio -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-800 to-gray-700 p-12 rounded-xl">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Meet Stuart Bain</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-300">Founder & Principal Solutions Architect</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
            <!-- Bio Content -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2">
              <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                Stuart brings over 25 years of technology leadership experience spanning military service, 
                enterprise consulting, and innovative startups. As a United States Marine Corps veteran and 
                AWS Certified Solutions Architect, he combines tactical precision with strategic vision to 
                deliver complex technology solutions.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                Prior to founding Packetvision, Stuart served as a Senior Partner Solutions Architect at 
                Amazon Web Services, where he specialized in government integrations and secure cloud deployments. 
                His tenure at Red Hat as a Senior Consultant focused on containerization and DevSecOps for 
                defense organizations, including pioneering work with the U.S. Navy's "Compile to Combat in 24 Hours" initiative.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                Stuart's unique background spans both Fortune 500 enterprises and innovative startups. At Dell Software, 
                he led performance monitoring practices for commercial and public sector clients. As CTO and later 
                CEO of AuctionServices.com, he drove technical innovation that positioned the company for successful acquisition.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Credentials -->
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4">Key Credentials</h3>
              <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-300">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span>
                  <span>25+ years IT leadership</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span>
                  <span>AWS Solutions Architect</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span>
                  <span>USMC Veteran (Intelligence)</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span>
                  <span>Active Security Clearance</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span>
                  <span>Red Hat Certified (former)</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span>
                  <span>CompTIA Security+ (former)</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
              
              <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4 mt-6">Education</h3>
              <div class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                <p><strong>BSBA Business Informatics</strong><br>American Sentinel University</p>
                <p><strong>Computer Science Studies</strong><br>Virginia Tech (USMC MECEP)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience Highlights -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Professional Journey</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          A career built on technical excellence, strategic leadership, and service to others
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <!-- AWS -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">AWS</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Amazon Web Services</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-2">2019–Present</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Senior Partner Solutions Architect specializing in government cloud deployments</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Red Hat -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">RH</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Red Hat</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-2">2016–2019</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Senior Consultant for containerization and DevSecOps in public sector</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Dell -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-xs">DELL</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Dell Software</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-2">2013–2016</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Practice Leader for Performance Monitoring and Management solutions</p>
        </div>

        <!-- USMC -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-xs">USMC</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">U.S. Marine Corps</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-2">1992–1998</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Intelligence Analyst (Sergeant) with classified IT systems experience</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Values & Approach -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="bg-gray-800 p-12 rounded-xl">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Values & Approach</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            The principles that guide how we work with clients and approach every project
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Technical Excellence</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
              We maintain the highest standards of code quality, security, and architecture design. 
              Every solution is built to scale, perform, and adapt to your evolving needs.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-purple-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Partnership Approach</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
              We work as an extension of your team, providing transparent communication, 
              collaborative decision-making, and knowledge transfer throughout every engagement.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-3">Mission-Driven</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
              Drawing from military service and enterprise leadership, we approach every project 
              with discipline, commitment, and an unwavering focus on mission success.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 to-purple-900 p-12 rounded-xl">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Ready to Work Together?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-200 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg">
        Whether you're planning a complex cloud migration, building a new application, 
        or implementing AI-powered automation, we're here to help you succeed.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="mailto:stbain@proton.me" id="about-contact" class="bg-white text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-100 px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors">
          Start a Conversation
        </a>
        <a href="/services" class="border border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-gray-900 px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors">
          View Our Services
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Email Obfuscation Script -->
  <script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
      // Obfuscate email addresses
      const email = 'stbain' + '@' + 'proton.me';
      const contactElement = document.getElementById('about-contact');
      
      if (contactElement) {
        contactElement.href = 'mailto:' + email;
      }
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>